# Session exhaust is private (hybrid .meta policy, 2026-07-02): handoffs,
# explorations, and session state live locally and are archived in the private
# promo repo under ops/. Handoffs committed before this policy stay tracked
# (gitignore does not affect tracked files). Audits/plans/research remain
# public by default, subject to the CLAUDE.md screen.
